### 测试需求分析接口
POST http://localhost:4399/assistant/analyze-requirement
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "做一个贪吃蛇游戏页面"
}

### 测试获取所有角色状态
GET http://localhost:4399/assistant/roles

### 测试获取所有消息记录
GET http://localhost:4399/assistant/memory


### 测试按角色获取消息记录
GET http://localhost:4399/assistant/memory?role=engineer



### 测试按原因获取消息记录
GET http://localhost:4399/assistant/memory?causeBy=WriteCodeAction

### 测试获取最近的消息记录
GET http://localhost:4399/assistant/memory?count=5

### 测试检查代码生成状态
GET http://localhost:4399/assistant/check-generation

### 测试终止代码生成
POST http://localhost:4399/assistant/stop-generation
